{title: Reach Out And Touch The Lord}
{key: C}

{comment: Chorus}
Reach [C]out and Touch the Lord As [F]He Walks [C]By
You'll Find He's Not too Busy To [Am]Hear Your heart [G]Cry
He's [C]Passing By this Moment all Your [F]Needs he will [C]Supply
Reach out and Touch the Lord As [G]He Walks [C]by

{comment: Verse}
On one [C]dark and stormy night, on his [F]way to raise the [C]dead.
Mighty were the throngs that pressed him, hungry [Am]for the living [G]bread.
I must [C]touch him cried a woman, I must [F]touch him or I'll [C]die.
She reached out and touched his garment as [G]he walked [C]by.
